{
  "name": "CRM Automation Dispatcher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "crm-automation",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "position": [0, 300],
      "webhookId": "crm-automation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Verificacion de seguridad del webhook del CRM.\n// 1) Firma HMAC-SHA256 sobre `${timestamp}.${rawBody}` con AUTOMATION_WEBHOOK_SECRET.\n//    rawBody se reconstruye en el MISMO orden de claves que firma el back\n//    (eventId,name,businessId,occurredAt,data) -> JSON.stringify deterministico.\n// 2) Ventana anti-replay de 5 min sobre X-Automation-Timestamp.\n// 3) Idempotencia por eventId en workflow static data (defensa en profundidad\n//    frente a reintentos del emisor).\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst secret = $env.AUTOMATION_WEBHOOK_SECRET || '';\nconst item = $input.all()[0].json;\nconst headers = item.headers || {};\nconst body = item.body || {};\n\nconst envelope = {\n  eventId: body.eventId,\n  name: body.name,\n  businessId: body.businessId,\n  occurredAt: body.occurredAt,\n  data: body.data,\n};\nconst rawBody = JSON.stringify(envelope);\nconst ts = Number(headers['x-automation-timestamp']);\nconst sig = String(headers['x-automation-signature'] || '');\n\nlet validSig = false;\ntry {\n  const expected = crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret).update(`${ts}.${rawBody}`).digest('hex');\n  const a = Buffer.from(expected, 'hex');\n  const b = Buffer.from(sig, 'hex');\n  validSig = a.length === b.length && crypto.timingSafeEqual(a, b);\n} catch (e) {\n  validSig = false;\n}\n\nconst fresh = Number.isFinite(ts) && Math.abs(Date.now() - ts) < 5 * 60 * 1000;\n\nconst store = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nstore.seen = store.seen || {};\nconst duplicate = !!store.seen[body.eventId];\n\nlet route;\nif (!secret || !validSig || !fresh) route = 'auth_failed';\nelse if (duplicate) route = 'duplicate';\nelse {\n  store.seen[body.eventId] = Date.now();\n  route = body.name;\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { route, eventId: body.eventId, businessId: body.businessId, name: body.name, data: body.data } }];"
      },
      "id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
      "name": "Verify & Route",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.route }}",
                    "rightValue": "auth_failed",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "auth_failed"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.route }}",
                    "rightValue": "user.invited",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "user.invited"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.route }}",
                    "rightValue": "password.reset_requested",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "password.reset_requested"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "fallbackOutput": "extra" }
      },
      "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333",
      "name": "Route by event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "unauthorized",
        "options": { "responseCode": 401 }
      },
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
      "name": "Respond 401",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [660, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "no-reply@tudominio.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.data.email }}",
        "subject": "={{ ($json.data.businessName || 'Tu cuenta') + ' — acceso a tu cuenta' }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:520px;margin:auto;color:#222\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">Hola {{ $json.data.firstName }},</h2>\n  <p>Se ha creado una cuenta para ti{{ $json.data.businessName ? ' en ' + $json.data.businessName : '' }}. Para activarla y elegir tu contrase&ntilde;a, usa el siguiente enlace:</p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0\">\n    <a href=\"{{ $json.data.inviteUrl }}\" style=\"background:#4f46e5;color:#fff;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block\">Activar mi cuenta</a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#666\">El enlace caduca el {{ $json.data.expiresAt }}. Si no esperabas este correo, ign&oacute;ralo.</p>\n</div>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555",
      "name": "Email: alta usuario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "position": [660, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": { "id": "REPLACE_WITH_SMTP_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "SMTP CRM" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "no-reply@tudominio.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.data.email }}",
        "subject": "Restablecer tu contraseña",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:520px;margin:auto;color:#222\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">Hola {{ $json.data.firstName }},</h2>\n  <p>Hemos recibido una solicitud para restablecer tu contrase&ntilde;a. Si fuiste t&uacute;, pulsa el bot&oacute;n:</p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0\">\n    <a href=\"{{ $json.data.resetUrl }}\" style=\"background:#4f46e5;color:#fff;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block\">Restablecer contrase&ntilde;a</a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#666\">El enlace caduca el {{ $json.data.expiresAt }}. Si no solicitaste esto, ign&oacute;ralo: tu contrase&ntilde;a no cambiar&aacute;.</p>\n</div>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666",
      "name": "Email: reset contraseña",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "position": [660, 480],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": { "id": "REPLACE_WITH_SMTP_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "SMTP CRM" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "ok",
        "options": { "responseCode": 200 }
      },
      "id": "77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777777",
      "name": "Respond 200",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [900, 360]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
